# UpgradeAtlas

Egypt-first, exact-SKU laptop buying & upgrade advisor (college project).

See `docs/PRD.md` for product scope and `docs/DECISIONS.md` for implementation decisions.

## Quick start (backend)

```bash
python -m venv .venv
. .venv/Scripts/activate
pip install -r services/api/requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env
cd services/api && alembic upgrade head
uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000
```

Local database: PostgreSQL 16, database `upgradeatlas`, role `upgradeatlas_app` (non-superuser owner).
